---
title: Schemat Blokowy Połączeń Sprzętowych
---
flowchart LR
  %% --- Left Board ---
  Disp1[Display] --> |VGA| Basys1 
  Kb1[Keyboard] <--> |USB/PS2| Basys1

  subgraph Basys1[Basys 3]
    direction TB
    CPU1[Artix 7]
    CPU1 --> D1[Diodes]
    CPU1 --> 7seg1[7seg]
    CPU1 --> B1[Buttons]
    CPU1 --> Sw1[Switches]
  end

  %% --- Left OptiBolt ---
  subgraph OB1[OptiBolt PMOD]
    direction LR
    Tx1[Tx LED]
    Rx1[Rx Photo]
  end

  Basys1 <--> |PMOD JB/JC| OB1

  %% --- Central Optical Link ---
  Tx1 ==> |TOSLINK Światłowód 1| Rx2 
  Tx2 ==> |TOSLINK Światłowód 2| Rx1 

  %% --- Right OptiBolt ---
  subgraph OB2[OptiBolt PMOD]
    direction LR
    Rx2[Rx Photo]
    Tx2[Tx LED]
  end

  OB2 <--> |PMOD JB/JC| Basys2

  %% --- Right Board ---
  subgraph Basys2[Basys 3]
    direction TB
    CPU2[Artix 7]
    CPU2 --> D2[Diodes]
    CPU2 --> 7seg2[7seg]
    CPU2 --> B2[Buttons]
    CPU2 --> Sw2[Switches]
  end
  
  Basys2 --> |VGA| Disp2[Display]
  Basys2 <--> |USB/PS2| Kb2[Keyboard]
